<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79473" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέπομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accompany, attend</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>, etc.; of an escort, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				27
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῇ ἐκφορᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IPE</u>
					12.17.24
				</span></i>
			 (Olbia, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>) : abs., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				89a
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδωδῇ μὲν καὶ πόσει . . παρέπεσθαι
					τὴν χάριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					667b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο μάλιστα ἐπὶ πάντων
			π</span>. <i>is common</i> to all, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				186a
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τισί</span>
			<i>to be imparted</i> to them, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.21.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b><i>to be a
				constant attribute</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀνθρώποις τοῦτο π. τὸ σύμπτωμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			 : in Logic, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παρεπόμενον</span>
			<i>consequence</i>, necessary or accidental, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				168b31
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παρεπόμενα</span>
			<i>concomitant circumstances</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				10.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παρεπόμενα γῄδια</span> the lands
				<i>appertaining</i> to a village, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1134.15
			</span></i> (V <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>).</div>
